    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a mysterious voice\u00a0lures a young girl into\u00a0a\u00a0secluded\u00a0home promising\u00a0her\u00a0candy, her friends must\u00a0venture inside\u00a0to\u00a0save\u00a0her, armed with nothing more the powers granted to them by their Halloween costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they be able to uncover the dark truth buried within, or will they crumble like broken mirrors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a horror<i>-</i>comedy visual novel </strong>with references to <i>certain IPs </i>taking place in the world of <i><strong>Echoes of G</strong></i>, an upcoming visual novel!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select one of two routes</strong> as you search through a shady home on Halloween night. Choose between the tomboyish Misako Harima  and the elegant Princess Quinn on your quest to find their friend, Echo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make choices</strong>  that will decide the fate of every single character and unlock multiple different endings. Choose wisely, as your decisions can lead to a good or bad ending for each of them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous</strong> <strong>artwork</strong> illustrated in a (mainly) monochrome style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the darkness</strong> that plagues Halloween!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: Contains brief instances of flashing lights.<i></i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a mysterious voice\u00a0lures a young girl into\u00a0a\u00a0secluded\u00a0home promising\u00a0her\u00a0candy, her friends must\u00a0venture inside\u00a0to\u00a0save\u00a0her, armed with nothing more the powers granted to them by their Halloween costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they be able to uncover the dark truth buried within, or will they crumble like broken mirrors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a horror<i>-</i>comedy visual novel </strong>with references to <i>certain IPs </i>taking place in the world of <i><strong>Echoes of G</strong></i>, an upcoming visual novel!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select one of two routes</strong> as you search through a shady home on Halloween night. Choose between the tomboyish Misako Harima  and the elegant Princess Quinn on your quest to find their friend, Echo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make choices</strong>  that will decide the fate of every single character and unlock multiple different endings. Choose wisely, as your decisions can lead to a good or bad ending for each of them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous</strong> <strong>artwork</strong> illustrated in a (mainly) monochrome style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the darkness</strong> that plagues Halloween!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: Contains brief instances of flashing lights.<i></i></strong></p>",
